    "valoracion": {
      "Resumen ONON JMR A-1.2": "<section><h2>ONON On Holding AG · Método A-1.2 · EN_REVISION</h2><p><strong>DCF FCFF Base US$40,81</strong> vs cierre US$31,94, MOS35% US$26,53. Conservador22,99, optimista64,94, disrupción13,29; media normal42,21.</p><p>Fuente CHF reportado y conversión proforma USD a FX0.8281 CHF/USD. LTM EBIT CHF444.1m, ingreso3220.4m; S/C1.65→2.0, EBIT17.5%, ROIC terminal22%, DCF USD WACC10.77%, g4%. ClaseB equivalente1/10; deuda leaseCHF562.5m. <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1cyilxyBVYI8Q7ouK8Ybm4SW5WFXP9SaPA--S_m3Fb7U/edit\">Hoja JMR A 46 tabs</a>; <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Z-4aYZ0BZvH4HeAV7dX_-OjlUN1ClKAXZgKIKyGAZRI/edit\">AZ Stocks DCF US$33.72</a>.</p><p>Los siete múltiplos y auditoría económica independiente pendientes.</p></section>"
